{"overview":"در تگزاس، این سریال انیمه‌شده زندگی فروشنده پروپان هانک هیل را دنبال می‌کند؛ او با همسر اوج‌پرور معلم اسپانیایی جایگزین، پسر خود بابی که می‌خواهد کمدین شود، و دخترچه ساده‌لوح لوانه زندگی می‌کند؛ هانک دیدگاه‌های محافظه‌کارانه‌ای درباره خدا، خانواده و کشور دارد، اما ارزش‌ها و اخلاق او اغلب توسط موقعیت‌های او، خانواده‌اش و همسایه‌ها/دوستانی که آبجو می‌نوشند، به چالش کشیده می‌شود.","tagline":"","overview_en":"Set in Texas, this animated series follows the life of propane salesman Hank Hill, who lives with his overly confident substitute Spanish teacher wife Peggy, wannabe comedian son Bobby, and naive niece Luanne. Hank has conservative views about God, family, and country, but his values and ethics are often challenged by the situations he, his family, and his beer-drinking neighbors/buddies find themselves in.","tagline_en":"Return of the king.","runtime":22,"status":"Returning Series","seasons":[{"n":0,"name":"ویژه‌ها","ep":15,"y":2010,"poster":"/457BrGa7NazmpLkxJSyVuGwxdAv.jpg"},{"n":1,"name":"فصل 1","ep":12,"y":1997,"poster":"/iooLAHYz3q5tietw70zvrEdOAzN.jpg"},{"n":2,"name":"فصل 2","ep":23,"y":1997,"poster":"/nAB3XAV9UqAIkQX0T0T724hFOJ2.jpg"},{"n":3,"name":"فصل 3","ep":25,"y":1998,"poster":"/fULhidKRT37Hp3VtcucBQAlLhRH.jpg"},{"n":4,"name":"فصل 4","ep":24,"y":1999,"poster":"/cEfduHDxc6fAOdaAY0QuKKq9cjM.jpg"},{"n":5,"name":"فصل 5","ep":20,"y":2000,"poster":"/p7M0keqak0MpmBWC3wMkQh1tqWW.jpg"},{"n":6,"name":"فصل 6","ep":22,"y":2001,"poster":"/iNqhRiSAmMMMBPqw1AqgEmAfBc0.jpg"},{"n":7,"name":"فصل 7","ep":23,"y":2002,"poster":"/xEPF2vM3mCZ1VWI8R1aC4zh0SEX.jpg"},{"n":8,"name":"فصل 8","ep":22,"y":2003,"poster":"/qoOWFxUEsJZQozcoh68TCa5ayvO.jpg"},{"n":9,"name":"فصل 9","ep":15,"y":2004,"poster":"/kcYS4DE2XPW45bLUwdGfCGb2Qx7.jpg"},{"n":10,"name":"فصل 10","ep":15,"y":2005,"poster":"/2LSFVxr3mUUTMzM6gwaNVZtXgYz.jpg"},{"n":11,"name":"فصل 11","ep":12,"y":2007,"poster":"/bzckxthb2ToSwKwiSDqIhMPkI0Y.jpg"},{"n":12,"name":"فصل 12","ep":22,"y":2007,"poster":"/rfVe0r614QpaA